# Vercel CLI falls back to .gitignore when this file is absent. That would be
# wrong here: .gitignore excludes app/books (generated audio, manifests, covers)
# because it is large and copyrighted, but that content IS the deployed site.
# This file exists so deploys keep shipping it.
# UPDATE 2026-08-27: media moved to Cloudflare R2 (see tools/publish_r2.py);
# deploys are code-only now, so app/books is excluded after all.
.venv-tts/
.venv-piper/
.piper-voices/
node_modules/
ios/
tools/
run/
supabase/
*.pdf
*.log
.git/
DESIGN.md
app/books/
